        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, IP network, work at home</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, IP network, work at home
The data set represents average values for one hour of IP network use for work at home per person;
UUID: efead584-d460-3c09-b30d-4b453ceba860
This data set includes the use of the IP core network for work at home data exchange (0.2 Mbit/s) for one hour taking into account IP router use and electricity consumption.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: IP core network device (IP router) derived from Cisco Service Router 1800 Series, maximal data rate: 100 Mbit/s, realistic: 25 Mbit/s. Power demand: 0.0042 kW at 1 Mbit/s. Band width for work at home: 0.2Mbit/s
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_efead584-d460-3c09-b30d-4b453ceba860.xml</text>
